ilder)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"FluentRead/FluentRead","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T07:01:59Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"38fa9512a8550f5c832e87b2a4ed7fd6fd39d670","github_link":"https://github.com/FluentRead/FluentRead/commit/38fa9512a8550f5c832e87b2a4ed7fd6fd39d670","commit_subject":"Merge pull request #1175 from FluentRead/codex/issue-1162-context-glossary-20261101","ai_tool":"Codex"},{"repo_name":"openfootmanager/openfootmanager","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T07:01:28Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"6a44a322dc85f38a4943ae9a29feca0ef9294539","github_link":"https://github.com/openfootmanager/openfootmanager/commit/6a44a322dc85f38a4943ae9a29feca0ef9294539","commit_subject":"fix(transfers): card review fixes: shared grid and sort control, deal button focus ring, tests that click and query by role","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"openfootmanager/openfootmanager","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T07:01:17Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"9f36d1289ad4ea2a8ea2f3947d04e59c282999f7","github_link":"https://github.com/openfootmanager/openfootmanager/commit/9f36d1289ad4ea2a8ea2f3947d04e59c282999f7","commit_subject":"Merge feat/player-cards into feat/transfers-cards","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"openfootmanager/openfootmanager","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T07:01:08Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"ec69a4bdddebbf8208025aff60b0cf03aed7ebae","github_link":"https://github.com/openfootmanager/openfootmanager/commit/ec69a4bdddebbf8208025aff60b0cf03aed7ebae","commit_subject":"refactor(scouting): the search uses the shared sortable fields","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"openfootmanager/openfootmanager","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T07:01:08Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"74bdc3ee79fa00338a08202ce6f6f17703581d57","github_link":"https://github.com/openfootmanager/openfootmanager/commit/74bdc3ee79fa00338a08202ce6f6f17703581d57","commit_subject":"Merge feat/player-cards into feat/scouting-cards","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"openfootmanager/openfo